│ "In a meta‐analysis of randomized controlled trials with time‐to‐event outcomes, an aggregate data approach may be   │
│ required for some or all included studies. Variation in the reporting of survival analyses in journals suggests that │
│ no single method for extracting the log(hazard ratio) estimate will suffice. Methods are described which improve     │
